WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.792
"I hope we reach the Western Paradise soon," said the Tang Monk.

2
00:00:07.793 --> 00:00:10.865
"This journey has been very dangerous."

3
00:00:10.866 --> 00:00:12.233
[g@Bajie nodded.

4
00:00:12.234 --> 00:00:16.899
"Those three demons tried to pickle me!"@g]

5
00:00:16.900 --> 00:00:20.245
Everybody laughed, even Bajie.

6
00:00:20.246 --> 00:00:24.681
"Wukong, what happened to those demons?" asked Wujing.

7
00:00:24.682 --> 00:00:27.427
[g@"Buddha took them away," said Wukong.

8
00:00:27.428 --> 00:00:30.100
"I'm sure they were punished."@g]

9
00:00:30.101 --> 00:00:33.906
"Thank you again for saving us," said the Tang Monk.

10
00:00:33.907 --> 00:00:35.783
Wukong waved his hand.

11
00:00:35.784 --> 00:00:38.246
[g@"It was nothing, Master.

12
00:00:38.247 --> 00:00:42.766
Buddha did most of the work."@g]

13
00:00:42.767 --> 00:00:48.036
The group felt a strong wind blow down from the mountains up ahead.

14
00:00:48.037 --> 00:00:52.313
A dark fog filled the sky and then disappeared.

15
00:00:52.314 --> 00:00:54.627
[g@The Tang Monk was nervous.

16
00:00:54.628 --> 00:00:58.919
"Wh-what caused that wind and fog?"@g]

17
00:00:58.920 --> 00:01:02.351
"Relax, Master," said Wukong.

18
00:01:02.352 --> 00:01:06.484
[g@"I'm sure it was something harmless—maybe some small demons.

19
00:01:06.485 --> 00:01:11.638
I'll go check."@g]

20
00:01:11.639 --> 00:01:16.338
The monkey walked up the road and around a bend.

21
00:01:16.339 --> 00:01:19.217
He heard laughter and looked up.

22
00:01:19.218 --> 00:01:24.701
High above the road, a fat monster was sitting on the edge of a cliff.

23
00:01:24.702 --> 00:01:28.535
Several little demons sat next to the monster.

24
00:01:28.536 --> 00:01:32.266
Wukong flew up to get a closer look.

25
00:01:32.267 --> 00:01:35.710
The fat monster appeared to be concentrating.

26
00:01:35.711 --> 00:01:44.388
Suddenly . . . "Braap!" A burp as loud as thunder blew down the mountain.

27
00:01:44.389 --> 00:01:48.715
The demons giggled and laughed.

28
00:01:48.716 --> 00:01:51.922
"That was your best burp yet!" cried one demon.

29
00:01:51.923 --> 00:01:53.908
[g@The monster patted his belly.

30
00:01:53.909 --> 00:01:57.422
"Yes, I'm proud of that one."@g]

31
00:01:57.423 --> 00:02:00.622
"Show us the fog again!" said another demon.

32
00:02:00.623 --> 00:02:04.457
"Coming right up!" said the monster.

33
00:02:04.458 --> 00:02:11.154
He covered one nostril with a finger, closed his eyes, and blew hard.

34
00:02:11.155 --> 00:02:17.985
Dark fog poured out of his other nostril.

35
00:02:17.986 --> 00:02:20.935
The demons clapped and cheered.

36
00:02:20.936 --> 00:02:23.256
[g@The monster smiled and then . . .

37
00:02:23.257 --> 00:02:28.981
"Braap!" More wind blew down the mountain.@g]

38
00:02:28.982 --> 00:02:32.568
[g@There was a roar of laughter.

39
00:02:32.569 --> 00:02:37.469
One demon nearly fell off the cliff.@g]

40
00:02:37.470 --> 00:02:39.719
Wukong shook his head.

41
00:02:39.720 --> 00:02:44.087
"I'm not worried about these demons," he said to himself.

42
00:02:44.088 --> 00:02:48.893
"They're disgusting but not dangerous."

43
00:02:48.894 --> 00:02:50.271
[g@The monkey smiled.

44
00:02:50.272 --> 00:02:54.427
"It does give me an idea though . . ."@g]

45
00:02:54.428 --> 00:02:59.221
Wukong returned to his companions, who were waiting alongside the road.

46
00:02:59.222 --> 00:03:02.584
"Did you see any demons?" asked Wujing.

47
00:03:02.585 --> 00:03:04.172
[g@Wukong shook his head.

48
00:03:04.173 --> 00:03:05.740
"The road is safe."@g]

49
00:03:05.741 --> 00:03:09.870
[g@Then the monkey pulled Bajie aside.

50
00:03:09.871 --> 00:03:12.194
"Bajie," he whispered.@g]

51
00:03:12.195 --> 00:03:13.765
[g@"There's a village up ahead.

52
00:03:13.766 --> 00:03:17.074
The people there are preparing a huge feast.@g]

53
00:03:17.075 --> 00:03:23.145
I saw vegetables, noodles, tofu, steamed buns, and all sorts of delicious food.

54
00:03:23.146 --> 00:03:27.033
I thought maybe you'd like to go before us and start eating."

55
00:03:27.034 --> 00:03:29.138
[g@Bajie licked his lips.

56
00:03:29.139 --> 00:03:31.522
"Thank you for thinking of me, Wukong.@g]

57
00:03:31.523 --> 00:03:34.366
[g@I am rather hungry right now."

58
00:03:34.367 --> 00:03:38.080
The pig turned to the Tang Monk.@g]

59
00:03:38.081 --> 00:03:42.573
"Master, I think I should go ahead and check the mountain too.

60
00:03:42.574 --> 00:03:45.157
I trust Wukong, of course.

61
00:03:45.158 --> 00:03:49.800
But we must protect you, and I'd like to be extra safe."

62
00:03:49.801 --> 00:03:51.622
The Tang Monk smiled.

63
00:03:51.623 --> 00:03:53.406
[g@"I'm impressed, Bajie.

64
00:03:53.407 --> 00:03:55.776
Thank you for doing extra work."@g]

65
00:03:55.777 --> 00:04:02.446
Bajie winked at Wukong and then headed up the road.

66
00:04:02.447 --> 00:04:07.347
"Braap!" The monster burped again, and another wind blew.

67
00:04:07.348 --> 00:04:14.666
Then he blew more fog from one nostril.

68
00:04:14.667 --> 00:04:19.119
The demons laughed hysterically.

69
00:04:19.120 --> 00:04:24.443
Suddenly there was a loud rumbling sound, and everyone was silent.

70
00:04:24.444 --> 00:04:26.941
[g@The monster patted his big belly.

71
00:04:26.942 --> 00:04:30.399
"I'm hungry."@g]

72
00:04:30.400 --> 00:04:33.031
The demons looked at one another.

73
00:04:33.032 --> 00:04:35.674
"I'm hungry too," said one.

74
00:04:35.675 --> 00:04:39.827
"It's probably time for lunch," said another.

75
00:04:39.828 --> 00:04:41.626
The monster stood up.

76
00:04:41.627 --> 00:04:46.116
"Let's go down to the road and find some people to eat!"

77
00:04:46.117 --> 00:04:51.702
The demons cheered and followed the monster down the mountain.

78
00:04:51.703 --> 00:04:56.633
When they got to the road, they made themselves look like people.

79
00:04:56.634 --> 00:05:00.118
The monster chuckled.

80
00:05:00.119 --> 00:05:05.887
"The next time someone comes along this road, it's lunchtime!"

81
00:05:05.888 --> 00:05:09.672
[g@For a few moments, they waited.

82
00:05:09.673 --> 00:05:13.832
Then a large pig came around the bend.@g]

83
00:05:13.833 --> 00:05:17.346
[g@"Hello!" said Bajie, smiling.

84
00:05:17.347 --> 00:05:23.838
"I'm here for the feast!"@g]

